{
  "name": "brownfield-change",
  "description": "A bounded change (feature/fix) to an existing project. This is the default workflow the systemic-audit skill's Phases 1-15 implement in full; a plain L1-L2 change uses only its early phases (see .claude/rules/00-execution-protocol.md impact levels).",
  "phases": [
